{# Tip line of the Feinwerk promotion kit (Page Filter Report's docs/promo-kit.md): under this plugin's admin page, after the feedback question.
   One compact line: the sentence, its link and the hide control; no label, no title (Peter, 2026-11-11). Footer variant A
   (Peter, 2026-11-13, Page Filter Report docs/footer.md): always exactly one line, the sentence ends with an ellipsis
   where it does not fit (full sentence in the DOM and in the title); link and hide stay visible. The banner and the
   context boxes (templates/_promoBox.twig) keep label and title.
   promo = PromoLine::variables() {id, placement, title, text, link, url, dismissDays}; hiding for 30 days and once per
   page in javascripts/promo.js. #}
<div class="fwpromo-line" data-fwpromo-id="{{ promo.id }}" data-fwpromo-placement="line" data-fwpromo-days="{{ promo.dismissDays }}">
    <span class="fwpromo-line__text" title="{{ promo.text }}">{{ promo.text }}</span>
    <a class="fwpromo-line__link" href="{{ promo.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{ promo.link }}</a>
    <button type="button" class="fwpromo-line__dismiss fwpromo-dismiss" title="{{ 'FeinwerkDeleteVisitsFilter_PromoDismiss'|translate }}"
            aria-label="{{ 'FeinwerkDeleteVisitsFilter_PromoDismiss'|translate }}"><span aria-hidden="true">&times;</span></button>
</div>
